1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 10=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,464 --> 00:01:43,928
The rough soldiers don't understand
the chain of command.

7
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,519
When we lose our temper,

8
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,159
we only know
how to take matters straight to the top.

9
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,959
What do you mean, Fengtai?

10
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:57,439
What can a bunch of rough soldiers do?

11
00:01:58,216 --> 00:02:01,040
If the entire barracks causes an
uproar over the Chinese New Year,

12
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:03,480
Jinling is the southern capital...

13
00:02:04,328 --> 00:02:06,344
I'm afraid
even if you try to cover it up,

14
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,840
you won't be able to.

15
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,280
Word will reach His Majesty.

16
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,800
Lin Fengtai,

17
00:02:12,919 --> 00:02:13,360
you...

18
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:19,680
In three days,

19
00:02:20,152 --> 00:02:21,944
before the office
closes for the holiday,

20
00:02:22,599 --> 00:02:24,039
I want to see those supplies

21
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:25,840
enter the barracks.

22
00:02:41,660 --> 00:02:44,080
(Ministry of Revenue)

23
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,176
Take 350 taels of silver

24
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,680
from my personal account.

25
00:02:46,776 --> 00:02:47,960
Use it all to buy live sheep.

26
00:02:48,008 --> 00:02:50,490
We'll give everyone an extra meal
tonight to keep out the cold.

27
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:51,919
Yes.

28
00:02:53,864 --> 00:02:55,590
My mother has been wanting to meet you.

29
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,800
Come to my home tonight
for a simple dinner.

30
00:03:00,879 --> 00:03:01,439
All right.

31
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:11,820
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

32
00:03:22,759 --> 00:03:23,560
Have you all decided?

33
00:03:24,232 --> 00:03:25,310
- Yes.
- Yes.

34
00:03:26,159 --> 00:03:27,360
Then tell me one by one.

35
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,360
Yuchan,

36
00:03:32,639 --> 00:03:34,960
I used to work in the tearoom.

37
00:03:35,719 --> 00:03:38,199
From tea leaves
and tea sets to refreshments,

38
00:03:38,504 --> 00:03:39,870
I wouldn't say I'm an expert,

39
00:03:39,928 --> 00:03:41,320
but I'm quite familiar with them.

40
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:44,039
I'd like to continue
working in the tearoom.

41
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:46,039
All right.

42
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,159
You can continue managing the tearoom.

43
00:03:49,208 --> 00:03:50,312
Thank you, Yuchan.

44
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:51,599
I'll do my best.

45
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:57,199
Yuchan,

46
00:03:57,368 --> 00:03:59,470
when my mother
served in First Madam's courtyard,

47
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:01,224
she was in charge
of the flowers and plants.

48
00:04:01,439 --> 00:04:03,039
I grew up learning from her

49
00:04:03,039 --> 00:04:04,560
how to tend plants and arrange flowers.

50
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:08,759
I'd like to take care
of the plants at Zhichun Hall.

51
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:11,639
Then I'll leave the plants
at Zhichun Hall to you.

52
00:04:11,816 --> 00:04:13,736
They've been neglected
for the past few years,

53
00:04:13,740 --> 00:04:15,224
and many have fallen into disrepair.

54
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:17,120
If you can restore Zhichun Hall

55
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:19,128
to its former abundance
of flowers and greenery,

56
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:22,759
First Madam
and Young Master will reward you.

57
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:24,959
Thank you, Yuchan.

58
00:04:25,439 --> 00:04:26,600
I'll do my very best.

59
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,480
Yuchan,

60
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,160
my grandmother taught me
needlework from an early age,

61
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,759
but I'm no good at it.

62
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:36,360
When I was a third-class maid,

63
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,560
I helped out in the kitchen.

64
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:40,600
The cook said my nose
was keener than a dog's.

65
00:04:40,648 --> 00:04:41,752
No matter what was cooking,

66
00:04:41,816 --> 00:04:43,560
I could smell it
even from the underworld.

67
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:47,160
She also said
all my memory must be in my tongue.

68
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:48,560
Once I've tasted something,

69
00:04:48,570 --> 00:04:51,224
I wouldn't forget it even after
drinking the Soup of Forgetfulness.

70
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:55,839
She also...

71
00:04:56,240 --> 00:05:00,040
Also said I have an appetite like a pig.

72
00:05:00,199 --> 00:05:02,560
I could even taste
every flavor in bean dregs.

73
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:04,399
What a simpleton.

74
00:05:04,439 --> 00:05:05,560
Was she really praising her?

75
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,399
You've said all that,

76
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:10,399
but you still haven't told me
what you know how to do,

77
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:11,439
what you can do,

78
00:05:11,439 --> 00:05:12,480
or what you want to do.

79
00:05:14,319 --> 00:05:15,079
I...

80
00:05:15,759 --> 00:05:16,519
It's nothing

81
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:17,600
to be ashamed of.

82
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:19,040
Speak up.

83
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,519
I know how to eat.

84
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,800
I can eat a lot.

85
00:05:24,639 --> 00:05:25,759
And I want to eat.

86
00:05:29,439 --> 00:05:31,000
What's there to be embarrassed about?

87
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,279
Food is the first necessity
for the people.

88
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:35,279
For now, stay by my side

89
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:37,480
and learn how to manage
Young Master's meals

90
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:39,000
and prepare banquets for his guests.

91
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:41,920
In time, you'll be put
in charge of the private kitchen.

92
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:48,639
Thank you, Yuchan.

93
00:05:48,839 --> 00:05:50,160
I'll study hard.

94
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,120
Lanxiang,

95
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:56,800
have you decided?

96
00:05:59,839 --> 00:06:01,720
That stubborn girl.

97
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:05,800
Yuchan,

98
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:09,519
I can cook, clean, do laundry, and sew,

99
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,399
but I only know the basics.

100
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:13,120
I'm not even as good as my mother,

101
00:06:13,192 --> 00:06:15,256
so I certainly
can't say I'm skilled at any of them.

102
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,079
I can read.

103
00:06:20,399 --> 00:06:21,759
If you don't mind,

104
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:24,600
I'd like to clean
and organize the inner study each day.

105
00:06:30,639 --> 00:06:31,439
It seems

106
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,600
you've kept your literacy

107
00:06:34,319 --> 00:06:35,560
well hidden.

108
00:06:37,928 --> 00:06:40,250
When I first entered
the residence and answered questions,

109
00:06:40,260 --> 00:06:42,030
Young Lady Zhao
thought I was too long-winded

110
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,390
and didn't let me finish.

111
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,519
Later,

112
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,600
I didn't think it was important,

113
00:06:46,879 --> 00:06:48,199
so I never mentioned it again.

114
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,160
I would never deceive my master.

115
00:06:50,270 --> 00:06:51,768
Before I even entered the residence,

116
00:06:51,816 --> 00:06:54,600
Old Master already knew I could read.

117
00:06:58,319 --> 00:06:59,360
Can you write?

118
00:07:00,568 --> 00:07:02,830
I used to copy sutras
with the nuns at the convent.

119
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:03,759
I can write,

120
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,879
but my handwriting isn't very good.

121
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,279
As long as you can write.

122
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:12,720
From now on, you'll
be in charge of the inner study.

123
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:15,800
It's the most important place
in Zhichun Hall.

124
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,360
If anything goes wrong,

125
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,120
you'll be severely punished.

126
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:23,480
Yes.

127
00:07:30,392 --> 00:07:31,870
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

128
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:37,879
You may go.

129
00:07:44,744 --> 00:07:47,500
First Madam thought Young Master
wouldn't return for a few more days,

130
00:07:47,510 --> 00:07:49,610
after the government offices
closed for the holiday.

131
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:51,410
She only instructed
the private kitchen today

132
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:52,790
to prepare some dishes for tasting.

133
00:07:52,888 --> 00:07:54,350
I've invited a friend over for dinner.

134
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:56,600
It's a good chance for him
to pay his respects to Mother.

135
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,160
Five Willow Fish.

136
00:08:15,336 --> 00:08:18,136
The main ingredient is black-backed
green carp from Wulong Pond.

137
00:08:18,216 --> 00:08:19,688
The accompanying ingredients are

138
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:23,600
winter mushrooms, winter bamboo shoots,
pickled ginger, and pickled cucumber.

139
00:08:25,959 --> 00:08:27,120
Braised Double Duck.

140
00:08:27,310 --> 00:08:28,456
The main ingredients are

141
00:08:28,504 --> 00:08:30,680
half a roast duck and half a white duck.

142
00:08:30,776 --> 00:08:32,616
The accompanying ingredients are

143
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:34,408
cooked ham
and rehydrated winter mushrooms.

144
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:50,919
Jinqi should've sent someone ahead

145
00:08:50,919 --> 00:08:52,159
to let us know you were coming.

146
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,759
We had so little time,

147
00:08:53,784 --> 00:08:55,240
so we couldn't prepare many dishes.

148
00:08:55,639 --> 00:08:57,960
I hope you won't mind the simple fare.

149
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,720
This is already quite a feast.

150
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:01,879
Madam,

151
00:09:02,159 --> 00:09:03,399
back when we were in the army,

152
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,240
if we could get

153
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,759
a bowl of piping hot meat soup, then...

154
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,759
I knew it. You've always

155
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:11,799
been fooling me,

156
00:09:12,088 --> 00:09:14,240
saying you feasted on fish
and meat in the barracks.

157
00:09:14,270 --> 00:09:15,448
There were so many of you,

158
00:09:15,496 --> 00:09:17,816
and you said everyone
ate well and enjoyed their meals.

159
00:09:23,159 --> 00:09:24,159
You're a grown man.

160
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:25,799
Aren't you embarrassed?

161
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,120
Don't follow his example.

162
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,840
Take your time.

163
00:09:32,159 --> 00:09:32,960
Thank you, Madam.

164
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:39,000
Jinqi is my only son.

165
00:09:40,159 --> 00:09:41,480
You saved Jinqi,

166
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,519
so you saved my life.

167
00:09:44,639 --> 00:09:45,480
From now on,

168
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,960
treat this place as your own home.

169
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,799
Once your sister moves in,

170
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,799
she'll be a young lady
of the Lin family.

171
00:09:57,159 --> 00:09:58,200
Our parents passed away,

172
00:09:58,728 --> 00:10:01,464
so my sister and I have depended
on each other since childhood.

173
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,039
As long as she's well,

174
00:10:03,759 --> 00:10:04,799
I'm well.

175
00:10:05,176 --> 00:10:07,624
We're family.
There's no need for such formalities.

176
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:08,879
Come, sit down.

177
00:10:14,279 --> 00:10:15,399
You're such

178
00:10:15,576 --> 00:10:16,910
a loyal and devoted young man.

179
00:10:17,519 --> 00:10:19,799
The more I see of you,
the more I like you.

180
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:21,559
Have some more.

181
00:10:23,919 --> 00:10:24,679
Mother,

182
00:10:25,399 --> 00:10:26,799
look at your son, too.

183
00:10:27,384 --> 00:10:28,552
Give your son some meat.

184
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,519
Put your bowl down.

185
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:32,960
If your father sees you,

186
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:35,279
he'll say I've spoiled my son

187
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:36,340
beyond all propriety again.

188
00:10:38,159 --> 00:10:39,799
Stop making that ridiculous face.

189
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:42,344
Mother, you have some, too.

190
00:10:42,408 --> 00:10:43,710
Ever since Young Master returned,

191
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,279
(Yinchen, Madam Qin's first-class maid)
Madam has been laughing much more.

192
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:46,799
Young Master is very filial.

193
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,440
He knows Madam has been upset

194
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,720
about his marriage,

195
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:52,039
so he's been doing everything
he can to cheer her up.

196
00:10:54,639 --> 00:10:55,399
Lanxiang.

197
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,080
How did it go?

198
00:11:00,159 --> 00:11:02,639
Were First Madam and Young Master
happy with today's banquet?

199
00:11:04,519 --> 00:11:06,080
Whether they were satisfied or not,

200
00:11:07,279 --> 00:11:08,320
I don't know.

201
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:15,639
But Madam and Young Master
were both all smiles.

202
00:11:17,279 --> 00:11:18,320
What about the guest?

203
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,840
He seemed easygoing.

204
00:11:20,870 --> 00:11:22,184
I'm sure there was no problem.

205
00:11:28,279 --> 00:11:29,799
My family is moving today.

206
00:11:30,879 --> 00:11:33,320
Guess where we're moving to.

207
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,279
Don't tell me it's our courtyard.

208
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:40,120
Last time my mother
went to see your parents,

209
00:11:40,130 --> 00:11:41,850
she noticed the place
next door was vacant.

210
00:11:41,860 --> 00:11:43,688
When she came back,
she told my grandmother.

211
00:11:44,879 --> 00:11:47,360
But the houses
in our courtyard are all old.

212
00:11:47,390 --> 00:11:49,192
They're damp in summer
and cold in winter.

213
00:11:50,799 --> 00:11:51,919
My grandmother said

214
00:11:52,030 --> 00:11:53,672
she doesn't mind the houses being old.

215
00:11:53,736 --> 00:11:56,320
What matters most
is having good neighbors.

216
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:59,440
Besides, there's
a well in the courtyard.

217
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,790
The water may be bitter,

218
00:12:00,856 --> 00:12:01,790
but it's still usable.

219
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:05,879
Then we'll be neighbors from now on.

220
00:12:06,159 --> 00:12:07,799
My parents will be delighted.

221
00:12:16,279 --> 00:12:17,039
Wujiu,

222
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:17,720
hurry up.

223
00:12:17,759 --> 00:12:19,080
Dinner's ready. Come and eat.

224
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,639
Coming.

225
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,879
Xiaolian's grandmother.

226
00:12:31,679 --> 00:12:32,840
Xiaolian's grandmother.

227
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:35,879
You're here.

228
00:12:36,039 --> 00:12:36,720
(Mai Lanzi)
Close the door.

229
00:12:36,799 --> 00:12:38,919
(Du Xiaolian's grandmother)
I figured you just moved in today,

230
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:41,440
and you still have
to go to work tonight.

231
00:12:41,768 --> 00:12:43,480
You probably wouldn't have time to cook,

232
00:12:44,159 --> 00:12:45,320
so I made some extra food.

233
00:12:46,039 --> 00:12:47,519
You shouldn't have.

234
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:49,480
You should keep it for yourselves.

235
00:12:49,679 --> 00:12:51,879
We've often troubled Xiaolian's mother

236
00:12:51,879 --> 00:12:53,519
to pass messages to Lanxiang for us.

237
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:55,919
And from now on, we may still

238
00:12:55,919 --> 00:12:57,320
have to trouble you quite often.

239
00:12:57,399 --> 00:12:58,279
It's no trouble.

240
00:12:59,879 --> 00:13:01,320
Then we won't stand on ceremony.

241
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,919
Yes, hurry and eat.

242
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:03,960
Eat while it's hot.

243
00:13:04,039 --> 00:13:05,480
You can finish unpacking afterward.

244
00:13:05,519 --> 00:13:07,679
If you ever have any heavy work to do,

245
00:13:07,919 --> 00:13:08,879
and Dasong isn't around,

246
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:10,720
just call Xu over to help.

247
00:13:11,639 --> 00:13:12,480
Thank you.

248
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,600
Go eat. I'm leaving.

249
00:13:15,279 --> 00:13:16,200
Take care.

250
00:13:16,424 --> 00:13:17,688
No need to see me out.

251
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:23,320
No wonder Xiaolian likes their daughter.

252
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,720
They're honest people.

253
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:27,399
They remember every kindness.

254
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,000
Try some.

255
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:51,039
Why did you buy liquor?

256
00:13:51,399 --> 00:13:52,600
What a waste of money.

257
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,480
I didn't buy it.

258
00:13:54,879 --> 00:13:56,080
It was a treat.

259
00:13:56,879 --> 00:13:58,960
Head Shopkeeper Huang and his family

260
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:01,096
suddenly said
they were moving to the estate.

261
00:14:01,639 --> 00:14:04,000
So Second Shopkeeper He
was promoted to head shopkeeper.

262
00:14:04,279 --> 00:14:05,600
He treated everyone to drinks.

263
00:14:05,759 --> 00:14:06,840
Why would he suddenly

264
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:08,480
give up his position at the shop

265
00:14:08,799 --> 00:14:09,720
and move to the estate?

266
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:13,840
It seems that when
Young Madam was in charge,

267
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,320
he made a mistake.

268
00:14:16,039 --> 00:14:18,480
Luckily, Young Master
dealt with him leniently.

269
00:14:18,639 --> 00:14:19,519
Otherwise,

270
00:14:19,608 --> 00:14:22,550
he would've ended up like Shopkeeper Liu
of the rice shop and his family,

271
00:14:22,799 --> 00:14:24,240
tied up and sold off.

272
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:26,600
Tell me,

273
00:14:27,016 --> 00:14:28,790
how could
a perfectly good married couple

274
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:32,080
suddenly decide to separate?

275
00:14:34,559 --> 00:14:35,879
Aren't you going to ask

276
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:38,759
who'll be the next second shopkeeper?

277
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,639
Who's the second shopkeeper?

278
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,720
Starting today,

279
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:50,279
you may call me Second Shopkeeper Xu.

280
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:54,279
Really?

281
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,720
Of course it's true.

282
00:14:55,759 --> 00:14:57,279
Everyone at the shop today

283
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,600
respectfully

284
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:00,240
called me Second Shopkeeper.

285
00:15:05,879 --> 00:15:06,879
Much obliged.

286
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:09,600
Who knows? One day,

287
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:13,480
I might become head shopkeeper.

288
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:16,639
Stop dreaming.

289
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:17,960
Think about it.

290
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:19,600
If it were really about ability,

291
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:21,720
was Head Shopkeeper Huang incompetent?

292
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,840
Was Shopkeeper Liu
of the rice shop incompetent?

293
00:15:26,279 --> 00:15:28,399
Yet everything changed overnight.

294
00:15:28,799 --> 00:15:31,159
One family was sent off to the estate,

295
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:33,320
and the other was sold off.

296
00:15:33,519 --> 00:15:35,320
Even their children suffered for it.

297
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:39,919
I'm only celebrating here at home.

298
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,159
Don't worry.

299
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,840
I'll be careful in everything I do.

300
00:15:42,910 --> 00:15:44,856
I won't ever get Lanxiang
dragged into trouble.

301
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:49,480
I don't care

302
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:52,879
whether you're a head shopkeeper
or a second shopkeeper.

303
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:54,679
All I want

304
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:56,480
is for you to handle things carefully

305
00:15:56,919 --> 00:15:58,679
and for Lanxiang to stay safe.

306
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:19,279
That smells wonderful.

307
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:20,480
Is this fresh tea?

308
00:16:20,519 --> 00:16:21,159
Yes.

309
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:23,799
Not bad, right?

310
00:16:26,559 --> 00:16:27,919
Come in and warm yourself up.

311
00:16:28,392 --> 00:16:29,550
Have a bowl of hot tea.

312
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:30,639
Take a break.

313
00:16:31,368 --> 00:16:32,296
Yuchan took Xiaolian

314
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:34,820
to the side gate to welcome
Young Lady Du into the residence.

315
00:16:35,039 --> 00:16:36,360
They should be back soon.

316
00:16:43,919 --> 00:16:45,000
Yuchan is back?

317
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,232
Would she like some hot tea?

318
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:49,200
Yuchan accompanied Young Lady Du

319
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,480
to First Madam's quarters

320
00:16:50,519 --> 00:16:51,879
to pay her respects to First Madam.

321
00:16:51,928 --> 00:16:54,030
She'll probably have
to kowtow to Old Madam as well.

322
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:55,679
She won't be back anytime soon.

323
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,240
Come on.

324
00:17:10,119 --> 00:17:10,839
Guess

325
00:17:11,359 --> 00:17:13,880
what Young Lady Du looks like.

326
00:17:18,088 --> 00:17:20,350
The Du family is registered
as a military household.

327
00:17:20,559 --> 00:17:22,960
Could she be a woman warrior?

328
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:34,319
Young Lady Du is fair and slender.

329
00:17:35,079 --> 00:17:36,960
She's very pretty.

330
00:17:37,319 --> 00:17:38,880
She has a lovely way of speaking.

331
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:42,160
She carries herself beautifully.

332
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:44,559
And she's very courteous and polite.

333
00:17:46,119 --> 00:17:47,160
I can't quite describe it.

334
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:49,480
She's just very likable.

335
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:51,440
Look.

336
00:17:52,599 --> 00:17:54,599
Yuchan.

337
00:17:59,759 --> 00:18:01,039
You don't need to stand up.

338
00:18:08,039 --> 00:18:08,920
Yuchan.

339
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:13,279
Since you like Young Lady Du so much,

340
00:18:14,319 --> 00:18:16,640
why don't you
go serve her at Luxue Lodge?

341
00:18:19,519 --> 00:18:20,279
Yuchan,

342
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:23,079
I won't do it again.

343
00:18:28,039 --> 00:18:28,920
All right.

344
00:18:29,359 --> 00:18:30,400
I'm not punishing you.

345
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:33,519
Young Lady Du brought one maid

346
00:18:33,544 --> 00:18:34,640
and one older servant woman.

347
00:18:34,696 --> 00:18:36,410
That's enough
to attend to her personally.

348
00:18:36,550 --> 00:18:38,216
But she's unfamiliar with the residence.

349
00:18:38,319 --> 00:18:40,319
First Madam is worried
she might need something

350
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:41,519
but feels too shy to ask.

351
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:43,519
So she asked me to find a lively maid

352
00:18:43,559 --> 00:18:44,640
to go to Luxue Lodge.

353
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,680
I'd already planned to send you.

354
00:18:46,968 --> 00:18:48,830
You'll only
be assigned there for a year or so.

355
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:50,599
You'll still belong to Zhichun Hall.

356
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:58,039
All right.

357
00:18:58,559 --> 00:18:59,319
I'll go.

358
00:19:00,079 --> 00:19:01,440
Young Lady Du's brother

359
00:19:01,550 --> 00:19:03,080
once took a blade for Young Master.

360
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:06,480
Young Master and First Madam
are both deeply grateful.

361
00:19:07,559 --> 00:19:08,319
Remember,

362
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:11,200
you're being sent there
by Young Master and First Madam.

363
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:14,079
If any thoughtless maids
or servant women

364
00:19:14,079 --> 00:19:16,200
look down on the poor
or shirk difficult work,

365
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:19,079
you need to assert yourself
and put them in their place.

366
00:19:20,279 --> 00:19:22,480
If you can't handle them, come to me.

367
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:24,359
Don't worry, Yuchan.

368
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,960
I'll take good care of Young Lady Du.

369
00:19:26,008 --> 00:19:27,920
I won't let her suffer
the slightest grievance.

370
00:19:46,519 --> 00:19:47,319
Young Lady Du,

371
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:48,680
watch your step.

372
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:49,480
All right.

373
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:54,119
Young Lady Du is here.

374
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:03,700
(Du Cuique, Du Zheng's younger sister)

375
00:20:06,024 --> 00:20:07,160
First Madam, Second Madam,

376
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:09,976
and the Second, Third,
and Fourth Young Ladies are all inside.

377
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:11,839
Thank you.

378
00:20:24,936 --> 00:20:27,688
(Lingdang, Du Cuique's personal maid)
First Madam, Second Madam.

379
00:20:29,992 --> 00:20:33,064
(Wang Lingxiao, Second Madam of
the Lin family, Lin Jinqi's second aunt)

380
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:36,720
This is the snow pear
and loquat paste I made.

381
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:38,440
It's perfect for winter.

382
00:20:38,488 --> 00:20:40,240
It nourishes the lungs
and replenishes yin.

383
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:47,960
Young Lady Du is here.

384
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:50,210
(Lin Xiushu, Madam Qin's daughter,
Fourth Young Lady of the Lin family)

385
00:20:50,220 --> 00:20:53,050
(Lin Xiuwan, Madam Wang's daughter,
Second Young Lady of the Lin family)

386
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:55,128
(Lin Xiuru, daughter
of Lin Changzheng's concubine)

387
00:20:55,130 --> 00:20:56,550
(Third Young Lady of the Lin family)

388
00:20:57,192 --> 00:20:59,880
(Snow Pear and Loquat Paste)
Did you write this?

389
00:21:01,039 --> 00:21:01,640
Yes.

390
00:21:02,184 --> 00:21:04,200
When I studied
herbal medicine with my teacher,

391
00:21:04,264 --> 00:21:05,990
I practiced calligraphy
for several years.

392
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,640
Your handwriting is excellent.

393
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:09,039
It's clear

394
00:21:09,279 --> 00:21:10,880
you put a lot of effort into it.

395
00:21:11,839 --> 00:21:12,640
Wonderful.

396
00:21:13,160 --> 00:21:14,039
Wonderful.

397
00:21:15,119 --> 00:21:17,839
The more I see of this girl,
the more I like her.

398
00:21:18,680 --> 00:21:19,759
If our Wan

399
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:22,039
were half as thoughtful
and capable as you,

400
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:23,720
I'd be smiling

401
00:21:23,759 --> 00:21:25,039
even in my dreams.

402
00:21:29,039 --> 00:21:29,599
Look at her.

403
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:32,240
I must have spoiled this girl rotten.

404
00:21:34,079 --> 00:21:35,079
Good girl,

405
00:21:35,559 --> 00:21:36,920
don't mind us.

406
00:21:37,119 --> 00:21:39,039
Go have fun with the other girls.

407
00:21:39,359 --> 00:21:39,839
Go on.

408
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:40,400
Go on.

409
00:21:41,519 --> 00:21:42,160
Yes.

410
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:47,839
Cuique,

411
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:48,599
come over here.

412
00:21:48,759 --> 00:21:49,519
Cuique.

413
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:53,759
What are you making, Xiuru?

414
00:21:55,656 --> 00:21:57,640
Old Madam asked us
to make some festive ornaments.

415
00:21:57,759 --> 00:21:59,359
On the seventh day, the Festival of Man,

416
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:01,672
we can give them to our elders,
relatives, and friends.

417
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:03,880
I ruined another one.

418
00:22:04,759 --> 00:22:05,440
I give up.

419
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:06,920
Xiuwan,

420
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:08,200
let me help you.

421
00:22:08,839 --> 00:22:09,599
You?

422
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:13,039
Forget it.

423
00:22:13,279 --> 00:22:14,559
You're even worse than I am.

424
00:22:19,559 --> 00:22:21,759
Old Madam gave us so many materials.

425
00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:23,559
If we can't make anything,

426
00:22:23,560 --> 00:22:25,200
I'm afraid we'll spend all of next year

427
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:27,200
confined to our rooms
learning needlework.

428
00:22:27,519 --> 00:22:28,720
Old Madam has a soft heart.

429
00:22:29,119 --> 00:22:30,400
We'll just coax her

430
00:22:30,640 --> 00:22:32,839
and say a few sweet words.
We'll be fine.

431
00:22:33,599 --> 00:22:34,799
Old Master...

432
00:22:41,279 --> 00:22:42,440
Would you like me to help?

433
00:22:44,640 --> 00:22:45,759
You know how to make them?

434
00:22:46,568 --> 00:22:48,260
My family was poor
when I was growing up.

435
00:22:48,456 --> 00:22:50,248
During festivals, we had nothing special

436
00:22:50,296 --> 00:22:51,880
to give our relatives and friends.

437
00:22:51,992 --> 00:22:54,780
I only made flower ornaments and
paper figures for the Festival of Man.

438
00:22:54,799 --> 00:22:56,880
After making so many,
I naturally learned how.

439
00:22:57,440 --> 00:22:58,880
Please make one for me.

440
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:00,440
All right.

441
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:24,920
Done.

442
00:23:29,759 --> 00:23:30,920
Let me see.

443
00:23:33,559 --> 00:23:34,759
That's amazing.

444
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:35,799
Please, Cuique.

445
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:37,640
I'd like a silk flower I can wear.

446
00:23:38,079 --> 00:23:38,960
A silk flower?

447
00:23:39,750 --> 00:23:40,264
All right.

448
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:58,319
Xiuwan.

449
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:02,279
Xiuru.

450
00:24:04,799 --> 00:24:06,160
This one is for Xiushu.

451
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:08,519
Do you like it?

452
00:24:12,359 --> 00:24:13,599
Can you make paper figures?

453
00:24:14,279 --> 00:24:14,839
Yes.

454
00:24:15,319 --> 00:24:16,400
Then teach me.

455
00:24:17,079 --> 00:24:19,119
I want to make Old Madam

456
00:24:19,176 --> 00:24:21,680
the Old Man of the South Pole
holding a peach of immortality.

457
00:24:21,839 --> 00:24:22,279
All right.

458
00:24:22,720 --> 00:24:24,000
Me too.

459
00:24:24,480 --> 00:24:25,079
All right.

460
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:26,200
Make mine first.

461
00:24:27,680 --> 00:24:28,039
Careful.

462
00:24:28,039 --> 00:24:28,960
It's a pity

463
00:24:30,640 --> 00:24:33,799
the Du siblings come
from a military household.

464
00:24:34,279 --> 00:24:35,119
You know,

465
00:24:35,480 --> 00:24:37,519
you're worried about Jinqi's marriage,

466
00:24:37,839 --> 00:24:39,960
and I'm worried about Wan's marriage.

467
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:42,240
If only the Du siblings

468
00:24:42,279 --> 00:24:44,559
came from a more prominent family,

469
00:24:45,200 --> 00:24:46,160
at least one of us

470
00:24:46,279 --> 00:24:48,480
would have nothing to worry about.

471
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:50,319
What nonsense are you talking about?

472
00:24:50,640 --> 00:24:52,039
The children might hear you.

473
00:24:52,559 --> 00:24:53,279
Xuemei,

474
00:24:53,839 --> 00:24:55,240
aren't you worried

475
00:24:55,240 --> 00:24:56,328
about Jinqi's marriage?

476
00:24:59,039 --> 00:24:59,720
Of course I am.

477
00:24:59,920 --> 00:25:00,759
Exactly.

478
00:25:02,599 --> 00:25:04,000
But for the next year or so,

479
00:25:04,279 --> 00:25:05,519
all I can do is worry.

480
00:25:06,519 --> 00:25:07,839
Old Master said

481
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:10,880
I must wait until the matter
with the Zhao family is settled

482
00:25:11,279 --> 00:25:12,880
before I can look for a match for Jinqi.

483
00:25:20,039 --> 00:25:21,319
What's more pressing now

484
00:25:21,519 --> 00:25:24,119
is finding a good match
for Young Lady Du.

485
00:25:24,584 --> 00:25:26,920
Only then will we have fulfilled
our promise to Du Zheng.

486
00:25:28,640 --> 00:25:31,359
Since Jinqi has chosen this path,

487
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:34,000
I'll feel more at ease
if he has a capable

488
00:25:34,359 --> 00:25:35,759
and loyal subordinate by his side.

489
00:25:35,759 --> 00:25:37,559
But really, Du Zheng...

490
00:25:38,160 --> 00:25:39,880
Even though their parents are gone,

491
00:25:40,039 --> 00:25:41,559
an elder brother is like a father.

492
00:25:41,704 --> 00:25:43,400
How could he let
his sister reach nineteen

493
00:25:43,432 --> 00:25:44,920
without arranging a marriage for her?

494
00:25:44,920 --> 00:25:46,559
You can't blame Du Zheng for that.

495
00:25:47,279 --> 00:25:49,400
Young Lady Du originally
wanted to enter the palace.

496
00:25:49,512 --> 00:25:51,800
With her background,
she could become an imperial consort?

497
00:25:57,720 --> 00:26:00,559
Young Lady Du wanted to enter
the palace as a palace maid

498
00:26:00,792 --> 00:26:03,528
and serve in the Six Bureaus
and Twenty-Four Offices.

499
00:26:03,720 --> 00:26:06,160
If she could become
a Records Keeper or Registrar,

500
00:26:06,559 --> 00:26:08,640
she'd hold a proper
Eighth-Rank or Seventh-Rank post.

501
00:26:09,624 --> 00:26:12,216
And that's nothing compared
with a Fifth-Rank Palace Secretary.

502
00:26:13,079 --> 00:26:15,119
Even noble consorts
and grand secretaries

503
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:17,000
would have to treat her with respect.

504
00:26:17,112 --> 00:26:18,360
I never imagined Young Lady Du

505
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:20,079
had such lofty ambitions.

506
00:26:20,280 --> 00:26:22,136
She wanted to become a female official?

507
00:26:22,640 --> 00:26:24,440
Unfortunately,
the times were against her.

508
00:26:25,224 --> 00:26:27,240
Female officials
have little influence these days.

509
00:26:27,736 --> 00:26:29,816
Du Zheng couldn't bear
to send his sister away,

510
00:26:29,912 --> 00:26:31,260
and after one delay after another,

511
00:26:31,759 --> 00:26:33,119
her marriage was put off until now.

512
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:34,960
No wonder.

513
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:36,599
No wonder.

514
00:26:36,799 --> 00:26:37,400
Done.

515
00:26:39,519 --> 00:26:40,160
Please, Cuique.

516
00:26:40,279 --> 00:26:42,000
I want a big peony.

517
00:26:42,240 --> 00:26:43,559
And I want a swift horse.

518
00:26:43,880 --> 00:26:44,440
Your horse...

519
00:26:44,440 --> 00:26:45,759
Make mine first.

520
00:26:46,440 --> 00:26:47,599
My horse is easy to make.

521
00:26:47,799 --> 00:26:49,079
Look at Young Lady Du.

522
00:26:49,720 --> 00:26:52,240
She's beautiful and gentle,

523
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:55,599
well-read, knowledgeable
about herbal medicine,

524
00:26:55,600 --> 00:26:56,792
and skilled at needlework.

525
00:26:58,079 --> 00:27:01,000
Now, with the Lin family's support,

526
00:27:01,848 --> 00:27:03,790
she'll surely
find a match she's happy with.

527
00:27:03,848 --> 00:27:05,848
While visiting people
over the Chinese New Year,

528
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:09,720
ask around and find her a suitable match
as soon as possible.

529
00:27:12,200 --> 00:27:14,319
Have you found a match for Wan yet?

530
00:27:14,680 --> 00:27:15,599
Xuemei,

531
00:27:15,600 --> 00:27:17,640
that's exactly
what I wanted to talk to you about.

532
00:27:18,519 --> 00:27:20,839
I'm worried sick over Wan.

533
00:27:22,660 --> 00:27:25,580
(Lin Jinqi's Inner Study)

534
00:27:25,580 --> 00:27:27,460
(Respectfully Presented by Lin Jinqi)

535
00:27:41,540 --> 00:27:45,620
(Best Wishes for a Joyous Spring)

536
00:27:51,380 --> 00:27:53,620
(Lin)

537
00:27:59,079 --> 00:27:59,720
Young Master,

538
00:27:59,799 --> 00:28:00,839
Young Lady Du is here.

539
00:28:05,039 --> 00:28:05,680
Young Lady Du,

540
00:28:05,799 --> 00:28:06,680
please come in.

541
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:14,310
Thank you for taking me in
and looking after me,

542
00:28:15,200 --> 00:28:16,759
I have nothing valuable to give you.

543
00:28:17,279 --> 00:28:18,400
So I made use of what I had

544
00:28:18,504 --> 00:28:20,640
and made some inexpensive festive ornaments.
[*Festive ornaments were popular New Year decorations in ancient China]

545
00:28:20,728 --> 00:28:22,456
It's just a small token
of my appreciation.

546
00:28:28,559 --> 00:28:29,799
That's very thoughtful of you.

547
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:33,160
Are you settling in well at Luxue Lodge?

548
00:28:34,440 --> 00:28:36,079
Old Madam and First Madam

549
00:28:36,232 --> 00:28:37,830
have both taken excellent care of me.

550
00:28:37,944 --> 00:28:40,888
Even the food, clothing, and daily
necessities are far better than at home.

551
00:28:40,890 --> 00:28:42,759
It took some getting used to at first,

552
00:28:43,464 --> 00:28:45,270
but it's easy
to grow accustomed to comfort,

553
00:28:45,319 --> 00:28:46,920
so I soon settled in.

554
00:28:50,519 --> 00:28:53,000
No wonder Congyi is
always singing his sister's praises.

555
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,720
You're open and forthright,

556
00:28:56,160 --> 00:28:57,319
more so than many men.

557
00:28:58,279 --> 00:28:58,839
Have a seat.

558
00:29:00,420 --> 00:29:02,430
You have so much
to attend to before the New Year,

559
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:03,200
Jinqi.

560
00:29:03,599 --> 00:29:04,759
I won't keep you any longer.

561
00:29:08,559 --> 00:29:09,240
Lanxiang,

562
00:29:09,279 --> 00:29:10,359
see Young Lady Du out.

563
00:29:25,799 --> 00:29:27,480
Young Lady Du
may say they're inexpensive,

564
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:30,440
but in the hands of someone
who appreciates the craftsmanship,

565
00:29:32,079 --> 00:29:33,440
they could fetch a decent price

566
00:29:33,440 --> 00:29:35,224
at the market before
the Chinese New Year.

567
00:29:39,119 --> 00:29:39,920
Lanxiang,

568
00:29:41,079 --> 00:29:43,119
put these on the windows.

569
00:29:45,400 --> 00:29:47,680
Put this pair on the screen.

570
00:29:49,799 --> 00:29:51,559
Take this one back to the bedroom.

571
00:29:51,640 --> 00:29:52,480
On the seventh day,

572
00:29:52,490 --> 00:29:53,990
it'll be perfect to wear in the hair.

573
00:29:54,559 --> 00:29:55,720
Baogai made some paste.

574
00:29:55,839 --> 00:29:58,119
I'll go get some so we can
put up the flower ornaments.

575
00:30:04,799 --> 00:30:05,400
Baogai,

576
00:30:07,064 --> 00:30:08,960
I was just coming
to get some paste from you,

577
00:30:09,319 --> 00:30:10,440
and here you are.

578
00:30:12,359 --> 00:30:13,519
What are you delivering?

579
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:15,160
I'll take it for you.

580
00:30:15,559 --> 00:30:16,680
Take the paste back first.

581
00:30:16,680 --> 00:30:18,220
It won't work as well once it gets cold.

582
00:30:18,720 --> 00:30:19,160
All right.

583
00:30:20,920 --> 00:30:23,000
These are flower ornaments
Young Lady Du made.

584
00:30:23,010 --> 00:30:25,270
Give them to Madam Han first
and have her put them away.

585
00:30:25,319 --> 00:30:27,780
Yuchan said they'll be needed
for the Festival of Man.

586
00:30:27,799 --> 00:30:28,240
All right.

587
00:30:36,712 --> 00:30:38,550
From what I've seen these past few days,

588
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:40,640
Xiaolian probably doesn't know anything.

589
00:30:41,359 --> 00:30:42,519
As for Lanxiang,

590
00:30:43,359 --> 00:30:44,119
it's hard to say.

591
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:47,759
That girl is discreet and cautious.

592
00:30:47,759 --> 00:30:49,319
She knows how to keep things to herself.

593
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:51,799
Jiugao has always suspected she knows.

594
00:31:00,248 --> 00:31:01,590
Even if she does know something,

595
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:03,976
there's no need
to pursue it any further.

596
00:31:09,960 --> 00:31:11,240
You mean...

597
00:31:12,376 --> 00:31:14,160
Whether my separation
from Young Lady Zhao

598
00:31:15,079 --> 00:31:16,000
was my fault

599
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:18,160
or hers?

600
00:31:19,079 --> 00:31:20,400
Of course it was her fault.

601
00:31:21,599 --> 00:31:22,759
Since she was at fault,

602
00:31:26,599 --> 00:31:28,039
why should I fear anyone finding out?

603
00:31:29,480 --> 00:31:30,119
But...

604
00:31:30,160 --> 00:31:30,880
Besides,

605
00:31:31,128 --> 00:31:32,160
you said it yourself.

606
00:31:32,728 --> 00:31:34,480
She knows how to keep things to herself.

607
00:31:35,640 --> 00:31:37,079
She knows what's at stake.

608
00:31:37,256 --> 00:31:38,720
Even if she's figured something out,

609
00:31:39,200 --> 00:31:40,359
she won't say anything.

610
00:31:42,600 --> 00:31:44,030
The Chinese New Year is almost here.

611
00:31:44,824 --> 00:31:46,200
Whatever happened in the past,

612
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:49,880
let it stay in the past.

613
00:31:54,359 --> 00:31:55,240
In the new year,

614
00:31:56,079 --> 00:31:57,400
everything begins anew.

615
00:32:24,792 --> 00:32:26,000
On Chinese New Year's Eve,

616
00:32:26,488 --> 00:32:28,312
I'll go to Old Master
and Old Madam's quarters

617
00:32:28,320 --> 00:32:30,480
and stay up with them
to welcome the Chinese New Year.

618
00:32:30,640 --> 00:32:31,880
You stay here at Zhichun Hall

619
00:32:31,992 --> 00:32:33,270
and enjoy the Chinese New Year.

620
00:32:37,440 --> 00:32:39,799
They say Young Master
became ruthless after spending

621
00:32:39,799 --> 00:32:41,279
several years in the army.

622
00:32:41,920 --> 00:32:44,160
But I think Young Master
is still the same as ever.

623
00:32:46,540 --> 00:32:48,940
(Best Wishes for a Joyous Spring, Lin)

624
00:32:49,559 --> 00:32:50,440
(Fortune)
Lanxiang.

625
00:32:51,000 --> 00:32:51,759
Thank you.

626
00:32:51,799 --> 00:32:52,559
You're here.

627
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:54,440
Hua. Do you know
how to play cat's cradle?

628
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:55,200
Sure.

629
00:32:56,359 --> 00:32:57,480
I want an apple.

630
00:32:57,848 --> 00:32:58,510
Put it here.

631
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,400
There, put it there.

632
00:33:10,480 --> 00:33:10,936
All right.

633
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:13,799
Lanxiang, teach me.

634
00:33:14,839 --> 00:33:15,599
Here.

635
00:33:17,039 --> 00:33:17,799
Pastries.

636
00:33:17,799 --> 00:33:19,039
Yuchan, play with me.

637
00:33:19,039 --> 00:33:19,680
Come on.

638
00:33:19,680 --> 00:33:21,000
I'll give you one more chance.

639
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:22,799
Lanxiang taught me.

640
00:33:26,056 --> 00:33:27,310
It's almost the fifth watch.

641
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:28,920
Let's go toss for fortune.

642
00:33:29,720 --> 00:33:30,880
Do we have to do it, too?

643
00:33:31,032 --> 00:33:33,030
The bolt on our courtyard gate
is pretty heavy.

644
00:33:33,079 --> 00:33:35,740
Even if we can lift it,
we won't be able to toss it very high.

645
00:33:35,759 --> 00:33:36,880
That's right.

646
00:33:36,952 --> 00:33:37,880
I'm not very strong.

647
00:33:37,880 --> 00:33:39,200
I definitely can't toss it high.

648
00:33:41,359 --> 00:33:42,680
If one person can't toss it high,

649
00:33:42,680 --> 00:33:44,400
can't two people do it together?

650
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:46,599
Who's doing it with me?

651
00:33:50,839 --> 00:33:51,599
I will.

652
00:33:51,799 --> 00:33:53,799
I'll join you
and try for some good luck.

653
00:33:55,839 --> 00:33:56,839
Bring the gate bolt over.

654
00:33:56,840 --> 00:33:58,184
We're going to toss for fortune.

655
00:33:58,200 --> 00:33:58,960
Toss for fortune.

656
00:33:59,039 --> 00:33:59,680
All right.

657
00:34:00,440 --> 00:34:00,920
Let's go.

658
00:34:09,800 --> 00:34:11,559
Girls, hold on tight.

659
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:13,840
Once the fifth watch begins,

660
00:34:14,119 --> 00:34:15,159
I'll count to three.

661
00:34:15,280 --> 00:34:16,719
Then we'll toss it up together.

662
00:34:17,119 --> 00:34:17,639
All right.

663
00:34:20,400 --> 00:34:21,400
Almost there.

664
00:34:36,159 --> 00:34:37,039
It's time.

665
00:34:38,599 --> 00:34:40,840
One, two, three.

666
00:34:41,679 --> 00:34:43,840
- Drop a fortune.
- Drop a fortune.

667
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:45,840
- Cats come, dogs come.
- Cats come, dogs come.

668
00:34:45,840 --> 00:34:47,840
- The God of Wealth comes to our home.
- The God of Wealth comes to our home.

669
00:34:47,840 --> 00:34:49,760
- Great ingots come rolling in.
- Great ingots come rolling in.

670
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:52,400
- Little ingots squeeze through the cracks in the door.
- Little ingots squeeze through the cracks in the door.

671
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:53,679
One, two, three.

672
00:35:11,199 --> 00:35:12,960
The pepper and cypress liquor
from Old Madam.

673
00:35:12,960 --> 00:35:15,000
The sweet dumplings from First Madam.

674
00:35:15,039 --> 00:35:16,719
Everyone, enjoy yourselves.

675
00:35:16,800 --> 00:35:17,960
Eat and drink your fill,

676
00:35:17,960 --> 00:35:19,639
and serve Young Master well next year.

677
00:35:19,848 --> 00:35:23,288
- Thank you, Old Madam and First Madam.
- Thank you, Old Madam and First Madam.

678
00:35:23,679 --> 00:35:24,320
Go get them.

679
00:35:24,400 --> 00:35:25,000
Come quickly.

680
00:35:25,480 --> 00:35:26,280
Sweet dumplings.

681
00:35:31,159 --> 00:35:33,079
This is Young Master's gift for Madam.

682
00:35:33,119 --> 00:35:34,050
Thank you, Young Master.

683
00:35:34,079 --> 00:35:35,880
This is Young Master's gift for you.

684
00:35:35,960 --> 00:35:36,980
Thank you, Young Master.

685
00:35:39,840 --> 00:35:41,280
All right, we'll be going then.

686
00:35:41,280 --> 00:35:42,280
Put it here. Put it here.

687
00:35:42,320 --> 00:35:43,760
Yuchan, smell this. It's so fragrant.

688
00:35:44,039 --> 00:35:44,760
There's so much.

689
00:35:44,824 --> 00:35:45,590
It smells wonderful.

690
00:35:45,639 --> 00:35:46,280
I love these.

691
00:35:46,320 --> 00:35:47,000
I want some.

692
00:35:47,010 --> 00:35:48,270
Come have some sweet dumplings.

693
00:35:48,280 --> 00:35:48,960
Madam Zhang!

694
00:35:49,760 --> 00:35:51,079
- Come quickly.
- All right.

695
00:35:51,679 --> 00:35:53,119
Let's put them on the table.

696
00:35:53,159 --> 00:35:53,679
Let's go.

697
00:36:20,800 --> 00:36:21,880
(First Madam...)

698
00:36:21,880 --> 00:36:23,159
(Live)

699
00:36:23,159 --> 00:36:24,760
(asked me to give this to you.)

700
00:36:31,460 --> 00:36:37,380
(May parents be safe and healthy. Live.)

701
00:36:46,980 --> 00:36:49,180
♪A lone figure
wanders down the old lane♪

702
00:36:50,480 --> 00:36:53,440
(Your unfilial daughter
borrows the fireworks filling the sky)

703
00:36:55,239 --> 00:36:57,719
(to make offerings to Father and Mother)

704
00:36:58,480 --> 00:37:00,280
(and the ancestors of the Shen family.)

705
00:37:01,840 --> 00:37:06,320
(May Father and Mother
be blessed with good health.)

706
00:37:09,039 --> 00:37:14,920
(May I care for my parents as Zilu did,
carrying rice home for them.)

707
00:37:14,960 --> 00:37:17,860
♪Step by step, page by page♪

708
00:37:18,220 --> 00:37:20,580
♪The portrait of my youth takes shape♪

709
00:37:20,940 --> 00:37:27,100
♪Let every doubt and restless
turn be carried on the wind♪

710
00:37:27,460 --> 00:37:30,260
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

711
00:37:30,620 --> 00:37:33,100
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

712
00:37:33,100 --> 00:37:40,060
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

713
00:37:52,660 --> 00:37:54,860
♪I walk through winding alleys♪

714
00:37:55,820 --> 00:37:57,980
♪And around weathered corridors♪

715
00:37:58,660 --> 00:38:03,460
♪One moment of peace
brings a little brightness♪

716
00:38:05,220 --> 00:38:07,460
♪I won't forget the long road
that brought me here♪

717
00:38:08,140 --> 00:38:10,580
♪Nor chase
the changing tides of the world♪

718
00:38:11,180 --> 00:38:16,820
♪I only wish
for one gentle ray of light♪

719
