737
00:39:20,519 --> 00:39:21,199
Grandfather.

738
00:39:29,224 --> 00:39:31,680
Old Madam saw that these
narcissus flowers were in full bloom,

739
00:39:31,800 --> 00:39:33,880
so she specially asked me
to bring them to you.

740
00:39:38,639 --> 00:39:39,400
Go on.

741
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:40,639
What is it?

742
00:39:42,024 --> 00:39:44,280
Aunt Lingxiao is worried
about Xiuwan's marriage.

743
00:39:44,290 --> 00:39:46,140
She wants to invite the Xie family over
[*The Festival of Man falls on the seventh day of the first lunar month]

744
00:39:46,159 --> 00:39:47,719
on the Festival of Man to meet her,

745
00:39:48,168 --> 00:39:50,632
but she's worried it would look
too obvious and invite gossip.

746
00:39:51,160 --> 00:39:52,590
So she went to Mother to discuss it.

747
00:39:53,079 --> 00:39:55,000
Mother took Aunt Lingxiao
to ask Old Madam,

748
00:39:55,800 --> 00:39:56,440
and Old Madam

749
00:39:57,159 --> 00:39:58,559
sent me here with these flowers.

750
00:40:07,039 --> 00:40:07,920
I know

751
00:40:09,079 --> 00:40:10,840
you don't want to draw attention

752
00:40:11,760 --> 00:40:12,960
because of my separation.

753
00:40:13,864 --> 00:40:16,072
But back then, because
of our family's circumstances,

754
00:40:16,232 --> 00:40:18,200
my eldest younger sister
was married off in haste.

755
00:40:18,760 --> 00:40:21,480
Old Madam has always regretted it.

756
00:40:24,079 --> 00:40:24,760
Yes.

757
00:40:42,119 --> 00:40:45,239
News arrived from
the northern capital this morning.

758
00:40:56,776 --> 00:40:58,920
His Majesty intends
to appoint Grand Secretary Zhao

759
00:41:00,119 --> 00:41:02,400
as chief compiler
of the Compendium of Literature.

760
00:41:03,039 --> 00:41:04,039
As expected.

761
00:41:04,376 --> 00:41:06,616
Once the imperial decree
is announced after the holiday,

762
00:41:06,632 --> 00:41:09,840
the Zhao family will rise even higher

763
00:41:10,199 --> 00:41:11,639
and become more powerful.

764
00:41:12,760 --> 00:41:15,599
By then, even if
Grand Secretary Zhao does nothing,

765
00:41:15,880 --> 00:41:18,280
there will still be people eager
to curry favor with him

766
00:41:18,599 --> 00:41:19,760
who will make trouble for you.

767
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:23,000
That's also as expected.

768
00:41:24,840 --> 00:41:27,079
When I gave up
the scholar's path and took up arms,

769
00:41:27,599 --> 00:41:28,840
I knew this day would come.

770
00:41:30,280 --> 00:41:31,760
You once taught me,

771
00:41:32,440 --> 00:41:33,880
misfortune may conceal good fortune,

772
00:41:34,040 --> 00:41:35,670
and good fortune may conceal misfortune.

773
00:41:36,199 --> 00:41:38,800
What seems like misfortune
may yet prove a blessing.

774
00:41:48,079 --> 00:41:48,639
Come.

775
00:41:49,119 --> 00:41:50,239
Write two characters.

776
00:41:51,519 --> 00:41:54,079
Let me see if taking up arms

777
00:41:54,559 --> 00:41:56,920
made you forget what you once learned.

778
00:42:30,460 --> 00:42:35,060
(Farewell to the Old, Welcome the New)

779
00:42:37,280 --> 00:42:39,760
Farewell to the old, welcome the new.

780
00:42:41,400 --> 00:42:42,320
Mother says

781
00:42:42,960 --> 00:42:45,280
marriage is like a woman's second birth.

782
00:42:45,640 --> 00:42:47,000
If she chooses the wrong husband,

783
00:42:47,360 --> 00:42:48,880
she'll suffer for the rest of her life.

784
00:42:51,159 --> 00:42:51,960
Grandfather,

785
00:42:52,840 --> 00:42:53,800
if my situation

786
00:42:54,679 --> 00:42:56,159
delays Xiuwan's marriage,

787
00:42:57,280 --> 00:43:00,400
Mother and I would both feel terrible.

788
